ation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"749da0bcf0da6c50\" href=\"?note=749da0bcf0da6c50\" title=\"73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive</span><span>73-theorem-5.5</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.4, print pp. 401–412; PDF pp. 423–434; local binary nonempty-tile representation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§8.5, pp. 193–201; local binary nonempty-tile coding"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PCP}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathsf{PCP}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" href=\"?note=3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" title=\"73-df-binary-pcp-coding\">73-df-binary-pcp-coding</a>，每个实例为非空的非空词对列表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PCP}\">\\(\\mathsf{PCP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PCP}\">\\(\\mathrm{PCP}\\)</span> 是下述固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 环境中的两个别名；不存在另一个未给定编码的 PCP 语言。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"285f46d94947b99e\" href=\"?note=285f46d94947b99e\" title=\"73-df-recursive-language-notation\">73-df-recursive-language-notation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span> 实例；不可判定性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"749da0bcf0da6c50\" href=\"?note=749da0bcf0da6c50\" title=\"73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.5}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{PCP}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{PCP}_{\\mathcal E},\\qquad\\mathrm{PCP}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{PCP}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.5}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{PCP}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{PCP}_{\\mathcal E},\\qquad\\mathrm{PCP}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{PCP}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PCP}\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PCP}\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应第三版的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-pcp-coding","status":"resolved","id":"3e0e5af1ab7985ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-pcp-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-rec